# LeakSanitizer suppressions (Linux ASan builds only; MSVC has no leak checker).
# Use:  LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=tools/lsan.supp ./build/linux-asan/bin/<game>
#
# SDL's PulseAudio backend thread allocates a per-thread error buffer that is
# never freed at exit. Not our bug, a known one-off at shutdown.
leak:SDL_GetErrBuf
